---
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const de = lang === 'de';
---
<section id="general-process" class="pt-12 md:pt-16 pb-10 md:pb-14 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">{de ? <>So funktioniert es</> : <>How it works</>}</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">{de ? <>Jeder Fall ist anders – deshalb starten wir mit Ihrem.</> : <>Every case is different, so we start with yours.</>}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-4 bottom-4 w-[2px] bg-slate-800 -translate-x-1/2"></div>

      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-6 md:mb-6 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%] text-right pr-2 sm:pr-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">{de ? <>Schritt 1: Sie</> : <>Step 1: You</>}</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">{de ? <>Schildern Sie uns Ihre Situation</> : <>Tell us your situation</>}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">{de ? <>Schreiben Sie uns per WhatsApp, E-Mail oder Kontaktformular, wo Sie stehen und was Sie brauchen. Je mehr Sie uns erzählen, desto besser können wir uns vorbereiten.</> : <>Message us on WhatsApp or email, or use the contact form. Tell us where you are and what you need. The more you share, the better we can prepare.</>}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">1</div>
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-6 md:mb-6 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-800 text-white border-2 border-blue-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">2</div>
        <div class="w-[45%] text-left pl-2 sm:pl-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-400 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">{de ? <>Schritt 2: taxomade</> : <>Step 2: taxomade</>}</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">{de ? <>Wir prüfen Ihren Fall</> : <>We review your case</>}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">{de ? <>Wir sehen uns Ihre Situation genau an, fragen nach, was noch fehlt, und sagen Ihnen klar, was für Sie gilt und was es kostet.</> : <>We look at your individual situation, ask about anything that is missing and tell you exactly what applies to you and what it costs.</>}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-6 md:mb-6 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%] text-right pr-2 sm:pr-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">{de ? <>Schritt 3: Sie</> : <>Step 3: You</>}</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">{de ? <>Sie bestätigen</> : <>You confirm</>}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">{de ? <>Sie geben uns grünes Licht und schicken die angefragten Unterlagen. Mehr müssen Sie meist nicht tun.</> : <>You give us the go and send the documents we ask for. That is usually all you need to do.</>}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">3</div>
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-6 md:mb-6 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white border-2 border-emerald-500 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm"><svg class="w-3 h-3 sm:w-4 sm:h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div>
        <div class="w-[45%] text-left pl-2 sm:pl-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/50 text-emerald-400 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">{de ? <>Schritt 4: taxomade</> : <>Step 4: taxomade</>}</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">{de ? <>Wir erstellen alles und reichen es ein</> : <>We prepare and file everything</>}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">{de ? <>Anmeldungen, Erklärungen und laufende Buchhaltung – auf Deutsch, Englisch oder Griechisch. Wir antworten meist innerhalb weniger Stunden, 7 Tage die Woche.</> : <>Registrations, filings and ongoing bookkeeping, handled in English. We usually reply within hours, 7 days a week.</>}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Notice -->
    <div class="mt-8 md:mt-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 inline-block mr-1 -mt-0.5 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>{de ? <>Den genauen Ablauf jeder Leistung finden Sie auf den jeweiligen <a href="#how-it-works" class="font-bold text-white underline hover:text-blue-400">Leistungsseiten</a>.</> : <>
        The detailed process for each specific service can be found on the respective <a href="#how-it-works" class="font-bold text-white underline hover:text-blue-400">service pages</a>.
      </>}</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
